{'symbol': 'ROP', 'date': '2023-06-06 11:00:00', 'title': 'SHIPWELL TMS ADOPTS DYNAMIC RATING AND ENHANCES LOAD BOARD ACCESS THROUGH INTEGRATION WITH DAT FREIGHT & ANALYTICS SOLUTIONS TO EXPAND OPTIONS FOR SHIPPERS', 'text': "AUSTIN, TEXAS--(NEWSFILE CORP. - JUNE 6, 2023) - SHIPWELL, PROVIDER OF THE AWARD-WINNING SHIPWELL TMS PLATFORM, TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS NEW INTEGRATION WITH DAT FREIGHT & ANALYTICS, NORTH AMERICA'S MOST EXTENSIVE AND TRUSTED FREIGHT MARKETPLACE. THIS COLLABORATION ENABLES SHIPWELL TMS CUSTOMERS WITH A DAT RATEVIEW SUBSCRIPTION TO ACCESS REAL-TIME DYNAMIC RATINGS, PROVIDING VALUABLE MARKET RATE INTELLIGENCE AND STRATEGIC DECISION-MAKING SUPPORT DIRECTLY WITHIN THEIR TMS SCREENS."}